   - Periodic keepalives firing and being acknowledged cleanly every ~60 s
   - AS-path loop rejections (correct BGP behaviour, not faults)
   - **Zero** NOTIFICATION messages, **zero** hold-timer expirations, **zero** BGP session drops post-startup
